Uncontrolled intercurrent [OR] or chronic illness 
Active autoimmune disease requiring immunosuppressive therapy within 30 days 
Active coagulation disorder [NOT] not controlled with medication 
Pregnant [OR] or lactating 
Concurrent malignancy (if in remission, at least 5 years disease [NOT] free) except for localized (in-situ) disease, [OR] basal carcinomas [OR] and cutaneous squamous cell carcinomas that have been adequately treated 
