ated in this study previously, [OR] or any other study using exenatide [OR] or GLP-1 analogs. \nHave participated in an interventional, medical, [OR] surgical, [OR] or pharmaceutical study within 30 days of screening. \nHave characteristics contraindicating metformin [OR] or sulfonylurea use. \n Have been treated with exogenous insulin for more than 1 week within the 3 months prior to screening. \n Have used drugs for weight loss within 1 month of screening.<|eot_id|>']
