over 18 years 
successful angioplasty (residual stenosis < 30%) on a significant stenosis (maximal systolic speed 3 times > from basal maximal systolic speed, stenosis > 70% on angiography) on the venous-prosthesis anastomosis [OR] or on the venous segment 5 cm after the anastomosis of a prosthetic haemodialysis vascular access (at least 1 month old) 
social security affiliation 
signed informed consent
