ng, and will be picked up by the dermatologist. \n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nThe study will include 40 post-deep peel women (exoderm), older than 18 years old, treated by the same dermatologist (dr. Landau). \nExclusion Criteria:\n- None\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nThe study will include 40 post-deep peel women (exoderm), older than 18 years old, treated by the same dermatologist (dr. Landau). \nExclusion Criteria:\n- None<|eot_id|>']
