History of exercise-related syncope 
MI within 6 mo [AND] and LVEF < 45% 
Evidence of systemic disease [OR] or neoplasia expected to compromise survival during 5-yr period 
Any disease [OR] or condition that interferes with completion of initial [OR] or follow-up assessments 
