al ulcers on Day 1. \nEndoscopically confirmed active upper gastrointestinal hemorrhage on Day 1. \nCurrent [OR] or past history of aspirin-induced asthma [OR] or hypersensitivity to NSAIDs. \nPast [OR] or planned surgery affecting gastric acid secretion. \nClinically significant hepatic [OR] or renal disorder. \nSerious cardiac dysfunction, [OR] hypertension, [OR] or hematological disorder.<|eot_id|>']
