h, in the opinion of the investigator, would interfere with their ability to participate in the study \n 2. Were taking a lidocaine-containing product that could [NOT] not be [NOT] discontinued while receiving lidocaine \n 3. Were taking class 1 anti-arrhythmic drugs (e.g., mexiletine, [OR] tocainide)<|eot_id|>']
