e drugs, corticosteroids or anorexigen       \n    \n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nDiagnosis of type 2 diabetes\nExclusion Criteria:\nischemic heart disease [OR] or any abnormality on treadmill stress test\ninflammatory [OR] or chronic disorder\npregnancy\nlactation\ncreatinine level of 1,5 mg/dL or more\ngastrointestinal problems [OR] or musculoskeletal disorders that would [NOT] prevent them to follow the test diets [OR] or exercise interventions\nliver dysfunction [AND] with a factor of at least 3 above the upper limit of normal in AST [OR] and ALT levels\nthyroid dysfunction, [AND] with serum TSH out of normal limits\nuse of immunosuppressive drugs, [OR] corticosteroids [OR] or anorexigen<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Diagnosis of type 2 diabetes
Exclusion Criteria:
ischemic heart disease [OR] or any abnormality on treadmill stress test
inflammatory [OR] or chronic disorder
pregnancy
lactation
