her significant medical conditions that will impact follow up within this program. \nThose less than 18 years of age. \nConcomitant interstitial lung disease, [OR] sarcoidosis, other significant lung disease. \nThose who have had a transplant. \nSignificant travel with work. \n[NOT] Unable to make appointments (every three to six months over 2 years). \nThose residing in another country [OR] or planned [NOT] absence for more than one month.<|eot_id|>']
