] or females aged >/= 50 years \n[NOT] No significant disease [OR] or drug use \n [NOT] Absence of any sign of dementia/ [OR] cognitive impairment in neuropsychological examinationsPatients for brain imaging: \nPatient and designee capable of giving fully informed consent in writing \nPatient fulfils DSM-IV [AND] and NINCDS-ADRA criteria for probable Alzheimers disease<|eot_id|>']
