nformed consent or to comply with study assessments (e.g. due to cognitive impairment [OR] or geographic distance).\nAge = 17.\nAllergy to povidone iodine.\nAny condition requiring antibiotics 14 days prior to arriving for surgery.\nPatients with chronic immunosuppression (such as HIV/AIDS).\n [NOT] Unable to adhere to follow up schedule and treatment.\nPatients scheduled to undergo revision total knee arthroplasty for infectious reasons.<|eot_id|>']
