interferon alfa-2a\nHBV DNA < 200 IU/ml during nucleos(t)ide analogue (except Telbivudine) treatment within one month prior to initiation of peginterferon alfa-2a\nCompensated liver disease\nAge > 18 years\nWritten informed consent<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Chronic hepatitis B (HBsAg positive > 6 months)
HBeAg [NOT] negative within six months prior to initiation of peginterferon alfa-2a
HBV DNA < 200 IU/ml during nucleos(t)ide analogue (except Telbivudine) treatment within one month prior to initiation of peginterferon alfa-2a
Compensated liver disease
Age > 18 years
Written informed consent
