endon transfer, [OR] tenodesis [OR] or arthrodesis that is available\nEvidence of recovering finger/ [OR] thumb extension at 4-6 months\nGreater than 12 months from spinal cord injury\nExclusion Criteria:\nSubject not fluent in English or an appropriate translator not available<|eot_id|>']
