cept local skin cancers)\nIschemic stroke (determined using the Questionnaire for Verifying Stroke-Free Status (QVSFS)\nPatients on renal dialysis [OR] or with end-stage hepatic dysfunction\nAcute infection/ [OR] inflammation (Temperature > 101.5 F, [OR] and/or WBC> 15, 000)\nInability to obtain informed consent from patient or next of kin\nAnticoagulant use (warfarin [OR] or heparin)<|eot_id|>']
