ast one lesion that can be accurately measured in at least one dimension (longest diameter to be recorded on CT); Patients must have previously [NOT] untreated locally advanced [OR] or metastatic NSCLC; Patients must have lung cancer [AND] with a documented EGFR activating mutation (exon 19 deletion, [OR] L858R).<|eot_id|>']
Response: Pathologic confirmation of lung adenocarcinoma [AND] with measurable disease, defined as at least one lesion that can be accurately measured in at least one dimension (longest diameter to be recorded on CT); Patients must have previously [NOT] untreated locally advanced [OR] or metastatic NSCLC; Patients must have lung cancer [AND] with a documented EGFR activating mutation (exon 19 deletion, [OR] L858R).
