tistical Manual (DSM)IV (SCID-R) and DSM-IV criteria);\nAge of onset of first episode = 50 years [AND] with up to three depressive episodes;\nSeverity of depression: A 24-Item Hamilton Depression Rating Scale (HDRS) = 20.<|eot_id|>']
