 °C [OR] or <36,0 °C\nAudible abnormalities by chest examination compatible with pneumonia\nLeukocytosis (>10.000 cells/mm3), leftward shift (>10%) [OR] or leucopenia (<4000 cells/mm3)\nC-reactive protein > 15 mg/l (three fold higher than the upper limit of normal)<|eot_id|>']
