1. Unable to understand and sign the consent form 
2. Are pregnant [OR] or lactating 
3. Are physically [NOT] unable to sit upright and still for 40 minutes 
4. Have undergone bilateral mastectomy 
5. Are [NOT] not scheduled to undergo conventional ultrasound
