nclusion Criteria:\nVeteran receiving care within the Veterans Health Administration healthcare system\nAge 18 years\nPhysician diagnosis of chronic heart failure, [OR] American Heart Association Stage C-D\nLVEF <45%\n [NOT] No change in active cardiac medications for 4 weeks prior to randomization\nAbility to provide informed consent\nModerate [OR] to severe central [OR] or mixed central [OR] and obstructive sleep apnea, defined as an apnea-hypopnea index (AHI) 15 events per hour, [AND] with a central AHI >5 events/hour<|eot_id|>']
