 prostate [OR] or bladder surgery patients [AND] who are = 60 years old.\nthe surgery is laparoscopic surgery [AND] and is expected to last for = 2 hours under general anesthesia [AND] and the patient will stay in hospital for at least 7 days after surgery.\nlack of serious hearing [AND] and vision impairment [AND] and be able to read so that neurobehavioral tests can be performed.<|eot_id|>']
