ine < 1 UNL \n\n\n### Response:\nHistologic [OR] or cytologic diagnosis of stage IIIB/ [OR] IV NSCLC \nECOG PS: 0,1 \nUnidimensional [OR] or bi-dimensional measurable disease \nReceive prior treatment including first-line platinum-based chemotherapy, standard second-line chemotherapy [AND] and 1 EGF/ [OR] EGFR inhibitor \nEvidence of disease progression \nLife expectancy >12 weeks \nNeutrophils > 1.5 109/l, Platelets > 100 109/l, Hemoglobin > 9g/dl, Total bilirubin < 1.5 UNL, AST (SGOT) [AND] and ALT (SGPT) < 2.5 UNL, Alkaline phosphatases < 5 UNL, Creatinine < 1 UNL<|eot_id|>']
