hizophrenia       \n    \n\n\n### Response:\nCases (with a history of TBI): \n1. History of penetrating brain injury \n2. History of disabling neurological [OR] or psychiatric condition such as epilepsy (besides posttraumatic epilepsy), multiple sclerosis, [OR] cortical stroke, [OR] hypoxic-ischemic encephalopathy, [OR] encephalitis, [OR] or schizophrenia \nControls (without a history of TBI): \nHistory of disabling neurological [OR] or psychiatric condition such as epilepsy, [OR] multiple sclerosis, [OR] cortical stroke, [OR] hypoxic-ischemic encephalopathy, [OR] encephalitis, [OR] or schizophrenia<|eot_id|>']
