ge 65 years and older \nHypertension - [NOT] untreated (Systolic Blood Pressure (SBP) ≥ 140 mm Hg [OR] or Diastolic Blood Pressure (DBP) ≥ 90 mm Hg) [OR] or treated \nPhysical limitations evidenced by either: \nScore ≤ 10 on the Short Physical Performance Battery [OR] OR Walking speed < 1.2 m/sec during 400 m usual-paced test \nSedentary lifestyle, defined as <150 min/wk of moderate physical activity as assessed by CHAMPS questionnaire \nWillingness to participate in all study procedures<|eot_id|>']
