e:\nInclusion Criteria:\nHCV, [OR] HIV, [OR] or HDV coinfection.\nHCC [OR] or other malignancy within 3 years.\nDecompensated liver cirrhosis (CTP score = 7).\nUremia patients under hemodialysis [OR] or continuous ambulatory peritoneal dialysis [OR] or patients with Ccr < 50 mL/min\nPregnant [OR] or breastfeeding women.\nWomen [AND] of child-bearing potential (WOCBP) [AND] who are unwilling [OR] or [NOT] unable to use an acceptable method of contraception to [NOT] avoid pregnancy throughout the study [AND] and for up to 4 weeks after the last dose of study drug.<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
HCV, [OR] HIV, [OR] or HDV coinfection.
HCC [OR] or other malignancy within 3 years.
Decompensated liver cirrhosis (CTP score = 7).
Uremia patients under hemodialysis [OR] or continuous ambulatory peritoneal dialysis [OR] or patients with Ccr < 50 mL/min
Pregnant [OR] or breastfeeding women.
Women [AND] of child-bearing potential (WOCBP) [AND] who are unwilling [OR] or [NOT] unable to use an acceptable method of contraception to [NOT] avoid pregnancy throughout the study [AND] and for up to 4 weeks after the last dose of study drug.
