\'s judgement) during the duration of the trial\n\n\n### Response:\nMale [OR] or female = 2 years of age;\nHave sickle cell disease (confirmed by Hb electrophoresis [OR] or more specific tests) [OR] or other conditions [AND] with iron overload [AND] from repeated blood transfusions (see exclusion criteria for exceptions);\nBaseline LIC >7 mg/g dw (measured by MRI);\nPatients who have received [NOT] no less than 20 transfusions of RBCs;\nPatients who have received at least 1 transfusion per year in the last 2 years [AND] and who are expected to have a continuing requirement (based on Investigator\'s judgement) during the duration of the trial<|eot_id|>']
