0 \nClinical condition of the patient allows to carry out induction therapy: ECOG performance status: ≤ 2 [AND] and the Hematopoietic Cell Transplant-Co-morbidity Index (HCT-I): ≤3 \nInformed consent to participate in the study (ICF signed) \nThe second early induction start criteria is in addition to the listed above, the percentage of the blasts on the level >10% on 7th day.<|eot_id|>']
