persensitivity to morphine, [OR] naltrexone.\nA life expectancy (assessed by investigator) of less than 6 months [OR] or is [NOT] no longer capable of taking medication orally.\nUndergone surgery within 3 days prior to the first day of dosing.<|eot_id|>']
