vity to the active substance [OR] and/or any of the excipients of epoetin beta treatment\nPoorly controlled hypertension as assessed by the investigator\nHistory of Acute Myeloid Leukemia (AML) [OR] or high risk for AML\nAdministration of another investigational drug within 1 month before screening [OR] or planned during the study period\nPreviously documented evidence of Pure Red Cell Aplasia (PRCA)<|eot_id|>']
