dine\nOrgan dysfunction (renal/ [OR] hepatic failure [OR] or leukemia)\nCardiac disease (congenital [OR] or acquired)\nAirway [OR] or thoracic malformation\nCerebral palsy\nHypotonia\nNeed for premedication\nCurrent/ [OR] recent upper respiratory infection (within four weeks prior to the surgery)\nAsthma\nAllergy [OR] or intolerance to clonidine\n [NOT] Non-English speaking parents/ [OR] patients.<|eot_id|>']
