nd 85 Kg\nReferred for STEMI within 6 hours from beginning of chest pain [OR] or stable coronary artery disease requiring a loading dose of Prasugrel [OR] or Ticagrelor according to the international recommendations.\n [NOT] No previous treatment with Clopidogrel, [OR] Prasugrel [OR] or Ticagrelor.\nPatient fasting for at least 6 hours.\nAffiliate or receiving a social security system.\nWritten informed consent.<|eot_id|>']
Response: Patient over 18 years weighing between 65 and 85 Kg
Referred for STEMI within 6 hours from beginning of chest pain [OR] or stable coronary artery disease requiring a loading dose of Prasugrel [OR] or Ticagrelor according to the international recommendations.
 [NOT] No previous treatment with Clopidogrel, [OR] Prasugrel [OR] or Ticagrelor.
Patient fasting for at least 6 hours.
Affiliate or receiving a social security system.
Written informed consent.
