on for adhesive capsulitis as defined by the American Academy of Orthopedic Surgeons: Self-limiting condition resulting from any inflammatory process about the shoulder in which capsular scar tissue is produced, resulting in pain [OR] and limited range of motion; also called frozen shoulder\nMust be amenable to randomization into either cohort<|eot_id|>']
