t may interfere with clinical assessments\nAllergy [OR] or sensitivity to corticosteroids [OR] or any drug hypersensitivity [OR] or intolerance that would compromise patient safety [OR] or study results\nHistory of an adverse reaction to Cortrosyn™ [OR] or similar test reagents\nChronic infectious disease, system [OR] or organ disorder [OR] or other medical condition that would place patient at undue risk by study participation<|eot_id|>']
