/m2.\nPresence of any infertility factor other than anovulatory PCOS.\nPrevious history of ovarian surgery [OR] or surgical removal of one ovary.\nPrevious exposure to cytotoxic drugs [OR] or pelvic irradiation.\nOral hypoglycemic [OR] or hormonal therapy either currently [OR] or in the preceding 3 months.\nMetabolic [OR] or hormonal abnormalities<|eot_id|>']
