ing highly effective methods of contraception throughout the study duration inclusive of the 30-day safety follow up.\n\n\n### Response:\nPatient has participated in a combination trial where ruxolitinib was dispensed in combination with another study medication [AND] and the patient is still receiving combination therapy.\nPregnant [OR] or nursing (lactating) women, where pregnancy is defined as the state of a female after conception [AND] and until the termination of gestation, confirmed by a positive hCG laboratory test.\nWomen [AND] of child-bearing potential, defined as all women physiologically capable of becoming pregnant, unless they are using highly effective methods of contraception throughout the study [AND] duration inclusive of the 30-day safety follow up.<|eot_id|>']
