 or healthcare proxy\nContraindication to enoxaparin\nContraindication to aspirin\nEpidural [OR] or subdural hematoma\nPresence, [OR] or removal within the last 12 hours, of an epidural [OR] or spinal catheter, [OR] or recent (within the last 12 hours) epidural [OR] or spinal anesthesia/ [OR] procedures<|eot_id|>']
