atosis\nsigns for central dysfunction\nremaining vestibular function\nPatients are advised not to participate in the gentamicin arm if\nhearing is better than 30 deciBel (dB) in pure tone average (500, 1000, 2000, 3-4000 Hz) [AND] and speech discrimination better than 70%\nthe neurosurgeon aim at hearing preservation surgery [AND] and do [NOT] not want to risk gentamicin associated hearing loss<|eot_id|>']
