ticoagulation treatment at the time of the bleeding event, [OR] or\na cardioembolic event, which occurred on anticoagulation, [OR] or\na high risk profile of the patient, defined as a CHA2DS2-VASc score = 3 [AND] and a HAS-BLED score = 2<|eot_id|>']
