e biochemical criteria outlined above (refer to 1. Diagnosis of acromegaly) [AND] and with typical acromegalic features.\n [NOT] No prior use of somatostatin analogues.\nAdequate hepatic [AND] and renal function\nProvision of a signed written informed consent<|eot_id|>']
