story, if applicable (natural menopause at least 12 months prior to first study drug administration; [OR] or surgical menopause by bilateral ovariectomy at least 3 months prior to first study drug administration), in addition: in women < 65 years old, follicle stimulating hormone (FSH) > 40 IU/L<|eot_id|>']
