Response: Non survivable injury
Multiple significant trauma (i.e. significant intracranial [OR] and extracranial injuries including limb fractures) that would [NOT] limit observation of recovery from spinal cord injury
Other conditions that would [NOT] limit clinical assessment of outcomes (e.g. dementia, [OR] demyelinating disease, [OR] autoimmune disease, etc)
Refusal of treatment [OR] or contraindication to NeuroAiD
