Criteria:\nDiagnosed with cutaneous vasculitis, [OR] urticaria, [OR] psoriasis, [OR] acne, [OR] bullous skin diseases, [OR] sterile pustulosis, [OR] leprosy, [OR] pneumocystis pneumonia [OR] and any other patients [AND] who need dapsone administration.\nSubjects are dapsone- [NOT] naive.\nAll subjects must have a clinical need for treatment [AND] with dapsone that precedes the decision to participate in the study.\nAll subjects are willing to complete the 6-weeks period clinical trial.\nAll subjects are written informed consent.<|eot_id|>']
