  -  Claustrophobia, [OR] or the [NOT] inability to lie still in a confined space
  -  Major medical disorders (e.g., HIV, [OR] cancer)
  -  Magnetic metallic implants (such as screws, [OR] pins, [OR] shrapnel remnants, [OR] aneurysm clips, [OR] artificial heart valves, [OR] inner ear (cochlear) implants, [OR] artificial joints, [OR] and vascular stents)
