 English.\n\n\n### Response:\nCurrent inpatient hospitalization [OR] or active suicidal ideation requiring referral for inpatient hospitalization for safety.\nHistory of psychotic disorder [OR] or manic episode diagnosed by MINI-KID\nHistory of substance dependence diagnosis by MINI-KID (excluding tobacco) [OR] or positive urine toxicology.\nPregnancy (urine pregnancy tests on the day of scans for menstruating girls).\nInability to provide written informed consent according to the Yale Human Investigation Committee (HIC) guidelines in English.<|eot_id|>']
