atients with Magnetic resonance imaging contraindication,including claustrophobic syndrome patients\n5. Patients with recent (less than 3 years) use chemical drugs or have obvious psychological problems\n6. In the past 2 months involved in other drugs or devices clinical trials\n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\n1. Patients with lumbar common diseases(e.g., Lumbar disc, [OR] Lumbar spinal stenosis, [OR] Lumbar slippage, etc)\nExclusion Criteria:\n 2. Researchers think that Patients with disease may be interference results(e.g., Spinal deformity, [OR] spine fracture, [OR] ankylosing spondylitis, [OR] spinal tuberculosis [OR] and spinal infection, [OR] spinal tumor, [OR] pelvic inflammatory disease [OR] and other disease of department of gynaecology, etc)\n 3. Patients with other nervous system diseases(e.g., cerebral tumor, [OR] neurinoma, [OR] trigeminal neuralgia,etc)\n 4. Patients with Magnetic resonance imaging contraindication,including claustrophobic syndrome patients\n 5. Patients with recent (less than 3 years) use chemical drugs [OR] or have obvious psychological problems\n 6. In the past 2 months involved in other drugs [OR] or devices clinical trials<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
1. Patients with lumbar common diseases(e.g., Lumbar disc, [OR] Lumbar spinal stenosis, [OR] Lumbar slippage, etc)
Exclusion Criteria:
 2. Researchers think that Patients with disease may be interference results(e.g., Spinal deformity, [OR] spine fracture, [OR] ankylosing spondylitis, [OR] spinal tuberculosis [OR] and spinal infection, [OR] spinal tumor, [OR] pelvic inflammatory disease [OR] and other disease of department of gynaecology, etc)
 3. Patients with other nervous system diseases(e.g., cerebral tumor, [OR] neurinoma, [OR] trigeminal neuralgia,etc)
 4. Patients with Magnetic resonance imaging contraindication,including claustrophobic syndrome patients
 5. Patients with recent (less than 3 years) use chemical drugs [OR] or have obvious psychological problems
 6. In the past 2 months involved in other drugs [OR] or devices clinical trials
