s written informed consent.\n\n\n### Response:\nHistory of three or more consecutively failed In Vitro Fertilization (IVF) cycles after embryo transfer.\nNormal uterine cavity (as assessed by hysteroscopy [OR] or HSG).\nNormal hormonal investigation: TSH, [OR] PRL, [OR] FBS.\n Normal acquired/ [OR] inherited thrombophilia profile: LAC, [OR] ACA IgG/ [OR] IgM, [OR] Prot S, [OR] Antithrombin III, [OR] beta-2 glycoprotein, [OR] Factors V, [OR] II, [OR] MTHFR.\nNormal semen analysis [AND] and mild/ [OR] moderate male factor (Total motile sperm count > 5 million/ml [OR] and/or normal WHO morphology >20%.\nPatient provides written informed consent.<|eot_id|>']
