ts of the formulation).\n\n\n### Response:\nParticipation in another clinical trial.\nKnown [OR] or suspected (or history of) malignancy [OR] or chronic illness.\n Serious organic [OR] or mental disease diagnosed by a psychiatrist (e.g., major depression currently treated with antidepressant medication) suspected on the basis of the medical history [OR] and/or clinical examination.\nConditions that may affect the compliance to the study.\n Contraindications to therapy with the study drug [OR] or hypersensitivity to the study drug (active ingredient [OR] or excipients of the formulation).<|eot_id|>']
