ing physician at the time of admission to the hospital.\nEstimated gestational age greater than 20 weeks\nHemodynamically stable [AND] and appropriate for induction of labor as per primary clinical health team in house\nWomen [AND] with one prior low transverse cesarean delivery<|eot_id|>']
