mation weekly\nExclusion Criteria:\nhistory of cardiovascular, gastrointestinal, renal [OR] and endocrinological diseases\n treatment with drugs that affect blood glucose\nhistory of cognitive [OR] and psychiatric [OR] diseases\nalcohol [OR] and drug abuse\npregnancy [OR] and breastfeeding\nconcomitant diseases that [NOT] prevent participation in the study<|eot_id|>']
