size, initially scored BI-RADS® 3, [OR] 4a, [OR] 4b [OR] or 4c in B-mode ultrasound \nInformed consent about histological examination (core cut biopsy (CCB), vacuum-assisted biopsy (VAB), fine needle aspiration (FNA) [OR] or surgery) has already been given in the course of clinical routine \nSigned informed consent of study participation<|eot_id|>']
