g\nPregnancy.\nDiagnosis of chronic pain currently taking opioid pain medication [OR] or with a history of drug abuse.\nPatients with a self-described allergy to ASA, [OR] acetaminophen, [OR] NSAIDS [OR] and codeine.\nAll patients receiving a brachial plexus block for anesthesia [OR] and/or analgesia<|eot_id|>']
