dequately treated [NOT] non-melanoma skin cancer, curatively treated in-situ cancer of the cervix, [OR] or other solid tumor curatively treated [AND] with [NOT] no evidence of disease for <= 5 years.\nHas known active central nervous system(CNS) metastases\n Has an active infection requiring systemic therapy\nPregnancy [OR] or breast feeding\nPatients with cardiac problem\nAny previous treatment with sunitinib<|eot_id|>']
