hemia (Rutherford category 4 or 5)\nPatients with signed informed consent\nTarget lesion length =150 mm by angiographic estimation\nStenosis of more than 50% in femoropopliteal artery\n At least one patent (less than 50 percent stenosed) tibioperoneal runoff vessel.<|eot_id|>']
